{"case_id": "male_19611230_P003-Q11", "domain": "unknown", "question": "大约哪个时间段，运程最佳？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "D", "raw_answer": "### 推理分析\n\n命主生于1961年12月30日丑时，八字为辛丑 庚子 丁酉 辛丑。丁火日主生于子月，正处寒冬，金寒水冷，财杀两旺。丁火在地支无根，天干亦无印比生扶，身弱至极。根据调候与扶抑原则，冬月丁火急需木火暖局助身，方能任财官。因此，运程喜走东南木火之地。\n\n大运排盘：年干辛为阴，男命逆排。从月柱庚子逆排。出生于大雪（12月7日）后约23日，按3日1岁计，起运约在8岁。大运依次为：8-17岁己亥，18-27岁戊戌，28-37岁丁酉，38-47岁丙申，48-57岁乙未，58-67岁甲午。\n\n- 己亥、戊戌运，土泄火制水，但土金水仍旺，身弱无补，运程平平。\n- 丁酉、丙申运，天干透比劫帮身，但地支酉、申金生水，财旺生杀，压力和奔波难免，虽有帮扶但助力有限。\n- 乙未运（48-57岁），乙木为偏印，未为木库且内含丁火，木火齐来，暖局生身，日主转旺，足以担财官。未土又冲丑土，开财库，是为佳运。\n- 甲午运（58-67岁），甲木正印高透，午火为丁火禄刃，木火强盛，身强印旺，金水得制，格局臻至高峰，无论事业财富均为鼎盛时期。\n\n对比选项时间段：  \nA. 23-32岁 约处戊戌、丁酉运，运势低迷或初起。  \nB. 33-42岁 约处丁酉、丙申运，虽有比劫但地支仍为金水，坎坷多阻。  \nC. 43-52岁 约处丙申、乙未运，42岁后转入乙未佳运，但前期丙申运仍为金水，仅后半段见好。  \nD. 53-62岁 恰处乙未运末与甲午运全盛时期，木火力量达到顶点，冬火得暖，财官为我所用，运程最佳。\n\n### 最终答案：D", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "male_19611230_P003-Q11", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-final-2023\\dev\\2024_b1a_prime_0_g1\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 89751, "response_id": "f576f3d2-e824-4a38-ac5c-c57ff3414a8e", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 215, "completion_tokens": 2900, "total_tokens": 3115, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 2352}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 0, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 215}}
{"case_id": "male_19611230_P003-Q12", "domain": "relationship", "question": "何时结婚？", "expected_answer": "A", "predicted_answer": "A", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字分析，丁火日主生于子月，金水旺而身弱，财星多现。男命以财为妻，财多身弱需行帮身大运方能成婚。命主7岁起运，17-26岁行戊戌大运，伤官帮身，但戌酉无直接引动；27-36岁行丁酉大运，丁火比肩帮身，酉金伏吟妻宫，引动婚姻宫，是成婚的最佳时期。此运对应命主年龄27-36岁（约1988-1997年），其后37-46岁丙申运虽也有机会，但不如丁酉运直指妻宫。故最可能在23-32岁时段（含27岁后）完婚。\n\n最终答案：A", "correct": true, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "male_19611230_P003-Q12", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-final-2023\\dev\\2024_b1a_prime_0_g1\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 26518, "response_id": "0fc2bc8a-9b23-4579-bb1e-f17a344e30cb", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 208, "completion_tokens": 1408, "total_tokens": 1616, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 1233}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 0, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 208}}
{"case_id": "male_19611230_P003-Q13", "domain": "career", "question": "有官非刑事出现的时间？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "B", "raw_answer": "首先分析命局：丁火日主生于子月，七杀当令，地支酉丑合金生水，天干庚辛金财星旺极，全局金水成势，日主丁火孤立无援，身弱无疑。用神喜木火，忌金水。官非刑事多应官杀为忌，刑冲引动之时。\n\n排大运：年柱辛丑，辛为阴干，男命逆排。月柱庚子，逆推上一节气大雪（1961年12月7日），出生日12月30日，距大雪约23天，折算起运约7岁5个月。大运依次为：己亥（7-17岁）、戊戌（17-27岁）、丁酉（27-37岁）、丙申（37-47岁）、乙未（47-57岁）。\n\n分析各年龄段：\n- A.13-22岁，行己亥运末及戊戌运初。己亥运会亥子丑水局，杀旺攻身，但年龄尚小，多病灾而非官非。戊戌运伤官制杀，丑戌相刑，易有口舌冲突，然戌为火库帮身，不致重刑。\n- B.23-32岁，行戊戌运末及丁酉运初。丁酉运与日柱丁酉伏吟，双酉自刑，财星忌神漫野，财生杀旺，酉酉自刑主动自身，为官非牢狱之显象。尤其癸酉流年（1993年，命主32岁），岁运并临，七杀透干克身，双酉自刑加剧，因财或异性引发官非之兆极重。\n- C.33-42岁，行丁酉运末及丙申运初。丙申运劫财丙火被辛合，申子合水，身仍弱，官杀仍旺，但自刑之象已过，凶性稍减。\n- D.43-53岁，行丙申运末及乙未运初。乙未运食神制杀，未冲丑，有变动，但乙木生身，趋于平缓，非重刑期。\n\n丁酉运伏吟自刑为命局最大关隘，官非信息最强，应期在32岁癸酉年，故属23-32岁区间。\n\n最终答案：B", "correct": true, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "male_19611230_P003-Q13", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-final-2023\\dev\\2024_b1a_prime_0_g1\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 89788, "response_id": "113090ee-c68b-4a99-a88a-3be98bfdfddd", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 214, "completion_tokens": 4788, "total_tokens": 5002, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 4269}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 0, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 214}}
{"case_id": "male_19611230_P003-Q14", "domain": "unknown", "question": "有凶劫之灾出现的时间？", "expected_answer": "A", "predicted_answer": "A", "raw_answer": "### 推理分析\n\n命主八字为辛丑 庚子 丁酉 辛丑，日主丁火生于子月，地支金水一片，财杀极旺，丁火无根无印，为从弱格（从财官），喜金水，忌木火。\n\n大运方面，年干辛为阴，男命逆排，由月柱庚子逆推为己亥、戊戌等。生于12月30日，距上一个节气大雪（12月7日）约23天，3天为1岁，折合7岁零8个月起运，故1968年前以月柱庚子为运。\n\n分析各选项流年：\n- **A. 1965年乙巳**（4岁虚岁5岁）：未交大运，以庚子为运。流年乙巳，天干乙庚合，地支巳酉丑三合金局，日主唯一的根禄巳火被合化为金，使丁火得根又失，形成“从格破格”。此时金极旺，日主被克伐严重，易有性命之危或凶劫。\n- **B. 1968年戊申**（7岁）：流年戊申，申子合水，伤官生财，财官为喜，无灾。\n- **C. 1971年辛亥**（10岁）：大运己亥，流年辛亥，金水相生，皆为喜用，运势平顺。\n- **D. 1974年甲寅**（13岁）：大运己亥，流年甲寅，天干甲己合，地支寅亥合木，木旺生火，此为破格，但论凶险程度不及乙巳年禄根被合夺之灾。\n\n综合考虑，1965年乙巳流年，小儿从格遇假根被化夺，多主凶劫横祸。\n\n### 最终答案：A", "correct": true, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "male_19611230_P003-Q14", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-final-2023\\dev\\2024_b1a_prime_0_g1\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 47995, "response_id": "ec87361e-3f24-4deb-8a76-3493403d642b", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 219, "completion_tokens": 2455, "total_tokens": 2674, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 2041}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 91}}
{"case_id": "male_19611230_P003-Q15", "domain": "unknown", "question": "那个时段，破财最严重？", "expected_answer": "C", "predicted_answer": "B", "raw_answer": "命局丁火生于子月，七杀当令，天干庚辛双透，地支酉丑合金，财星极旺，日主无根，形成财多身弱之局。财为忌神，杀星克身，破财根源在于身弱不胜财，逢财运或财旺之地，必因财生灾。\n\n排大运：命主为阴年男命，大运逆排。生于1961年12月30日，上个大雪节气为12月7日，相距约23天，以三日为一岁计，约8岁起运。大运依次为：8-17岁己亥，18-27岁戊戌，28-37岁丁酉，38-47岁丙申，48-57岁乙未，58-67岁甲午。\n\n分析选项所覆盖的大运：\n- A：23-32岁，行戊戌运末及丁酉运前期。戊戌伤官制杀生财，丁火得戌库微根，虽伏吟日柱但略有支撑，破财非最重。\n- B：33-42岁，行丁酉运后期及丙申运前期。丁酉运比肩坐偏财，财星伏吟自刑，已多破耗；更逢丙申运，劫财坐正财，天干丙辛合水化杀，地支申子合水攻身，财旺生杀，身弱至极，劫财无情反为忌，此运因财致祸、破财最剧。\n- C：43-52岁，行丙申运后期及乙未运前期。前期延续丙申运凶性，但后期乙木印星透出生身，未土燥土冲丑制杀，局势逐渐转吉，破财程度减轻。\n- D：53-62岁，行乙未运后期及甲午运。甲午印比齐来，身转旺强，足以担财，财运回升，非破财时段。\n\n综合大运走势，33-42岁正值丁酉、丙申两运交接，忌神财运与杀旺攻身交叠，为一生中破财最严重之时段。\n\n最终答案：B", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "male_19611230_P003-Q15", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-final-2023\\dev\\2024_b1a_prime_0_g1\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 80147, "response_id": "6d98ed52-980e-4464-ad34-ac8a47553aa3", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 215, "completion_tokens": 4509, "total_tokens": 4724, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 4036}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 0, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 215}}
